    <!-- About -->
    <section class="section" id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-heading">About Me</h2>
        <div class="about-layout">
          <div class="about-bio">
            <p>
              I am a graduate student pursuing my Master's in Computer Science
              at Northeastern University, Boston (Sep 2025 – Present). I
              completed my B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering at Vellore
              Institute of Technology, Chennai (Sep 2021 – May 2025).
            </p>
            <p>
              My passion lies at the intersection of AI and Machine Learning,
              especially in healthcare applications. I have worked as an AI
              Product Engineer Intern at Medialogic Solutions, where I built a
              Django-based healthcare scheduling system using Random Forest for
              appointment prioritization, and as a Software Developer Intern at
              Bastian Solutions, where I developed a web-based RCS dashboard
              using C# and ASP.NET MVC.
            </p>
            <p>
              I have published research on traffic sign classification,
              multimodal emotion recognition, skin cancer detection, and
              diabetic retinopathy detection using deep learning.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-details">
